---
import SecondaryLayout from '../../layouts/SecondaryLayout.astro';
---
<SecondaryLayout
  title="About"
  description="For the living internet. Learn why Lythaus is building around human ideas, thoughtful discussion and meaningful contributions."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <section class="section">
    <h1>About Lythaus</h1>
    <p>
      For the living internet.
    </p>
    <p>
      We’re building a social platform where people share original perspectives,
      discover thoughtful discussion, and earn recognition through meaningful contributions.
    </p>
    <h2 id="our-principles">Our principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>People speaking for themselves.</strong> Experience, research, creative work and thoughtful questions all have a place.</li>
      <li><strong>Deliberate discovery.</strong> We’re building feed choices that help people find conversations worth joining.</li>
      <li><strong>Recognition through contribution.</strong> Reputation and rewards should reflect sustained, accountable participation. Payments do not buy credibility or Editorial standing.</li>
      <li><strong>Clear authorship.</strong> Permitted AI assistance must be disclosed and remain human-led. AI-generated content is not permitted for public publication.</li>
      <li><strong>Accountable decisions.</strong> Authorship review and harmful-content moderation serve different purposes. During alpha, authorised staff review appeals under our <a href="/terms">Terms</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Automated authorship signals, contribution rewards and the trained-reviewer
      appeal process are development work, not promises of current availability.
      See <a href="/features">Features</a> for the product direction and <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> for membership information.
    </p>
    <h2 id="the-team">The team</h2>
    <p>
      Lythaus is built by a small team passionate about creating healthier
      online spaces. We are based in South Africa and building for the world.
    </p>
    <p><a class="button primary" href="/#waitlist">Join the waitlist</a></p>
    <p>Joining does not guarantee an invitation or an access date.</p>
  </section>
</SecondaryLayout>
